    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want to \"become something new.\" i want to stay who i am. but if this keeps happening, there won't be anything left of me to even experience it. i'm just watching myself die in slow motion. it feels so much more dignified to just... leave while i still know who i am. does that make sense?",
